flowchart LR
    P[New post] --> CLS{Author class?}
    CLS -->|normal user| FO[Fan-out on write to follower feeds]
    CLS -->|celebrity| ST[Store once, no fan-out]
    FO --> FC[(Redis feed lists - recent IDs)]
    R[Feed request] --> MRG[Merge: own cache + celebrity recents]
    FC --> MRG
    ST --> MRG
    MRG --> HYD[Hydrate + rank] --> OUT[Feed]
